ComfyUI-Nomas
ComfyUI port of the Hy-Nomas model architectures by Tencent Hunyuan
(https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy-Nomas, Apache License 2.0).
The model code in nomas/ is a reimplementation on ComfyUI's ops; parameter names follow the
released checkpoints so the weights load unchanged. The prompt shaping, camera normalisation,
history selection and decoder windowing follow that repository's inference code.

The PixelUMM decoder (nomas/pixelumm.py) reimplements the inference port of NVIDIA PixelUMM's
generation expert (https://github.com/nv-tlabs/PixelUMM, code Apache License 2.0) shipped in
Hy-Nomas. Released PixelUMM weights and their derivatives, including Hy-Nomas's fine-tuned
PixelUMM decoder and any conversion of it, are under the NVIDIA One-Way Noncommercial License:
non-commercial research and evaluation only.

Hy-Nomas weights: https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-Nomas (Apache License 2.0, except as above).
